{"created": "2021-01-21T21:02:36.255295+00:00", "modified": "2021-01-22T00:27:20.102414+00:00", "id": 4440318, "conceptrecid": "4440317", "doi": "10.1016/j.physleta.2020.127032", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physleta.2020.127032", "metadata": {"title": "Searching for evidence of algorithmic randomness and incomputability in the output of quantum random number generators", "doi": "10.1016/j.physleta.2020.127032", "publication_date": "2020-11-18", "description": "<p>This upload contains the data and code used in the following paper:</p>\n\n<p>J. T. Kavulich, B. P. Van Deren, and M. Schlosshauer, &ldquo;Searching for evidence of algorithmic randomness and incomputability in the output of quantum random number generators,&rdquo; <em>Phys. Lett. A</em> 388, 127032 (2021), <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physleta.2020.127032\">doi.org/10.1016/j.physleta.2020.127032</a></p>\n\n<p>The contents of the data set are as follows:</p>\n\n<p>1) Random strings for two QRNGs and four PRNGs. For each RNG, a zip archive provides 100 strings containing 25 x 2<sup>26</sup> = 1,677,721,600 bits each.</p>\n\n<p>2) C++ code for the Chaitin&ndash;Schwartz&ndash;Solovay&ndash;Strassen (CSSS) and Borel-normality tests (code.zip, 13 KB).</p>\n\n<p>The bulk of this code is not ours, but was written and made publicly available at <a href=\"https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/research/groups/CDMTCS/export/80_random_seqs\">this link</a> by the authors of the following paper:</p>\n\n<p>A. A. Abbott, C. S. Calude, M. J. Dinneen, and N. Huang, <em>Phys. Scri.</em> 94 (2019) 045103, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1088/1402-4896/aaf36a\">doi:10.1088/1402-4896/aaf36a</a></p>\n\n<p>We have made just a few small modifications to their original code:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>For the CSSS tests, a text file containing the Carmichael numbers (for tests 1&ndash;3) and odd composites up to 100 (for test 4) is read in and used to perform the tests. (Note: The set of Carmichael numbers used in the tests was generously provided to us by R. G. E. Pinch. Reference: R. G. E. Pinch, The Carmichael numbers up to 10<sup>21</sup>, in: A.-M. Ernvall-Hyt&ouml;nen (Ed.), Proceedings of Conference on Algorithmic Number Theory, Vol. 46, Turku Centre for Computer Science, Turku, Finland, 2007, pp. 129&ndash;131.)</li>\n\t<li>We combined the first and second CSSS tests into a single program.</li>\n\t<li>We reformatted the display of the output, and included a VERBOSE flag for additional status output.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>3) Results from CSSS and Borel-normality tests in Python format (results.zip, 22 KB). This archive also contains a Python script (analyze.py) that reads the result files, carries out the statistical analysis, and displays the plots.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Van Deren, Brennan P.", "affiliation": "University of Portland"}, {"name": "Kavulich, John T.", "affiliation": "University of Portland"}, {"name": "Schlosshauer, Maximilian", "affiliation": "University of Portland", "orcid": "0000-0002-5180-9753"}], "keywords": ["Quantum random number generators", "Quantum randomness", "Algorithmic randomness", "Incomputability"], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "journal": {"pages": "127032", "title": "Physics Letters A", "volume": "388"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "4440317"}}]}}, "title": "Searching for evidence of algorithmic randomness and incomputability in the output of quantum random number generators", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4440318", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4440318?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physleta.2020.127032", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physleta.2020.127032", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.1016/j.physleta.2020.127032", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440317", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4440317", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:4440318/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:4440318/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4440318/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/requests"}, "updated": "2021-01-22T00:27:20.102414+00:00", "recid": "4440318", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "6357b109-3af7-4137-9a04-d496d588104f", "key": "ANU.zip", "size": 20977931506, "checksum": "md5:838cecb60b249fc484bec6f1e7bd6d85", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/files/ANU.zip/content"}}, {"id": "60198429-f19f-4d70-8b1c-3cc1d0fd1bc9", "key": "threefish.zip", "size": 20977931906, "checksum": "md5:5ba1aaa1b102159f8d74df4555ca6c01", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4440318/files/threefish.zip/c